{%- comment -%}
  STORE CREDIT BAR (26 Nov 2026). A signed-in customer with store credit sees "Your Marathon balance: R 350 — ready
  to spend" above the header on every page that uses layout/theme.liquid. Shop money format is "R {{amount}}", so
  money_without_trailing_zeros prints "R 350".

  Renders NOTHING for guests, for a customer with no store credit account in the browsing currency
  (`customer.store_credit_account` is nil then, per the Liquid docs), or for a zero balance.

  The line links to /account. The shop uses NEW customer accounts, so that is Shopify's hosted account page, which
  shows the balance itself and is not part of the theme. Credit is spent at checkout ("Apply store credit" under
  Payment) only when the customer is signed in there.

  Customer copy rule: no emojis, no staff names.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if customer and customer.store_credit_account and customer.store_credit_account.balance > 0 -%}
  {%- assign mc_credit = customer.store_credit_account.balance | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
  <aside class="mc-credit-bar" aria-label="Store credit">
    <a class="mc-credit-bar__link" href="{{ routes.account_url }}">
      <span class="mc-credit-bar__label">Your Marathon balance:</span>
      <span class="mc-credit-bar__amount">{{ mc_credit }}</span>
      <span class="mc-credit-bar__note"><span aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span> ready to spend</span>
    </a>
  </aside>
  <style>
    .mc-credit-bar {
      background: rgb(13 12 11);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
      font-family: var(--font-body-family);
      font-style: normal;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0 0.6rem;
      max-width: var(--page-width, 120rem);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
      color: rgb(247 248 250 / 0.75);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      letter-spacing: 0.02rem;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link { font-style: normal; }
    .mc-credit-bar__note { white-space: nowrap; }
    .mc-credit-bar__amount {
      color: rgb(247 248 250);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      letter-spacing: 0.03rem;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link:hover .mc-credit-bar__note,
    .mc-credit-bar__link:focus-visible .mc-credit-bar__note {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 0.3rem;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid rgb(247 248 250 / 0.6);
      outline-offset: -4px;
    }
    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      .mc-credit-bar__link { padding: 1rem 5rem; font-size: 1.35rem; }
    }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
